            "mimeType": "application/json; charset=utf-8",
            "text": "{\"data\":{\"movies\":{\"data\":[{\"id\":\"33960\",\"name\":\"H Is For Hawk\",\"showingStatus\":\"Now Playing\",\"urlSlug\":\"h-is-for-hawk\",\"posterImage\":\"a0bttvc6e1x8pv1ig39vbquc3w9c\",\"bannerImage\":\"47ron809gksf574wdo34br981sb5\",\"synopsis\":\"When Helen's beloved father passes away, she is knocked sideways by grief and loses herself in memories of their time birding and exploring the natural world together. She becomes obsessed with the idea of training her own goshawk, and so she brings the fearsome bird Mabel home to her life as a graduate fellow at Cambridge. \\n\\nHelen fills the freezer with hawk food and turns off her phone, ready to embark on the long, strange business of trying to train this wildest of animals. But as she labours to tame Mabel, a grieving Helen undergoes an untaming of her own. \\n\\nA record of a spiritual journey, H IS FOR HAWK is a story about memory and nature and how it might be possible to reconcile death with life and love.\",\"starring\":\"Claire Foy, Brendan Gleeson, Angus Cooper\",\"directedBy\":\"Philippa Lowthorpe\",\"producedBy\":\"Lena Headey, Dede Gardner, Jeremy Kleiner\",\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"duration\":128,\"genre\":\"Drama\",\"allGenres\":\"Drama\",\"rating\":\"12A\",\"trailerYoutubeId\":\"RJ29BBXfN64\",\"trailerVideo\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-01-23\",\"dateOfFirstShowing\":\"2026-01-23\",\"tmdbPopularityScore\":3.8577,\"tmdbId\":\"1243006\",\"dcmEdiMovieId\":\"477805\",\"dcmEdiMovieName\":\"H Is For Hawk [12A]\",\"siteId\":\"85\",\"titleClassId\":\"337\",\"showings\":[{\"id\":\"390403\",\"time\":\"2026-01-23T14:30:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":4,\"screenId\":\"117\",\"seatsRemaining\":184,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"reserved-seating\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"390404\",\"time\":\"2026-01-24T13:40:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":11,\"screenId\":\"117\",\"seatsRemaining\":177,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"reserved-seating\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"390409\",\"time\":\"2026-01-26T15:50:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":20,\"screenId\":\"117\",\"seatsRemaining\":168,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"reserved-seating tix-for-six\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"390406\",\"time\":\"2026-01-27T14:00:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":17,\"screenId\":\"117\",\"seatsRemaining\":171,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"reserved-seating tix-for-six\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"390407\",\"time\":\"2026-01-28T14:05:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":2,\"screenId\":\"117\",\"seatsRemaining\":186,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"reserved-seating\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"390408\",\"time\":\"2026-01-29T14:15:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":3,\"screenId\":\"117\",\"seatsRemaining\":185,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"reserved-seating\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"394845\",\"time\":\"2026-02-02T16:15:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":0,\"screenId\":\"117\",\"seatsRemaining\":188,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"reserved-seating tix-for-six\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"394846\",\"time\":\"2026-02-03T16:50:00Z\",\"ticketsSold\":1,\"screenId\":\"117\",\"seatsRemaining\":187,\"displayMetaData\":\"{\\\"classes\\\":\\\"reserved-seating tix-for-six\\\"}\"}]},{\"id\":\"29419\",\"name\":\"The History Of Sound\",\"showingStatus\":\"Now Playing\",\"urlSlug\":\"the-history-of-sound\",\"posterImage\":\"xokynvd5qe6fzyz3z930vnf7c20o\",\"bannerImage\":\"t11k38hrx8mr1dnqppin65d7swma\",\"synopsis\":\"In 1917, Lionel—a young, talented music student—meets David at the Boston Conservatory, where they bond over a deep love of folk music. Years later, Lionel receives a letter from David, leading to an impromptu journey through the backwoods of Maine to collect traditional songs. This unexpected reunion, ensuing love affair, and the music they collect and preserve, will shape the course of Lionel’s life far beyond his own awareness.\",\"starring\":\"Paul Mescal, Josh O'Connor, Molly Price\",\"directedBy\":\"Oliver Hermanus\",\"producedBy\":\"Andrew Kortschak, Sara Murphy, Oliver Hermanus, Zhang Xin, Andrea Roa, Lisa Ciuffetti, Thérèsa Ryan\",\"searchTerms\":\"\",\"